-rsi-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RSI 2025 Q4","e":"rsi","d":"2026-02-17","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Richard Schwartz","x":"In 2025, without the benefit of any new markets, we achieved record revenue of $1.13 billion, representing 23% year-over-year growth and exceeding the high end of our raised guidance range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/rush-street-rsi-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RSI 2025 Q4","e":"rsi","d":"2026-02-17","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Richard Schwartz","x":"Even more impressive, we grew adjusted EBITDA by 66% year-over-year to a record of $153.7 million, also exceeding the high end of our raised guidance and demonstrating the powerful operating leverage inherent in our business model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/rush-street-rsi-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RSI 2026 Q1","e":"rsi","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Jed Kelly","x":"Is that being driven more by what your marketing team is doing, maybe around AI and certain investments?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/rush-street-rsi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RSI 2026 Q1","e":"rsi","d":"2026-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Richard Schwartz","x":"Moving forward, we have assumed that we will have a new temporary 16% tax from mid-March through the end of the year when considering our raised guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/rush-street-rsi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RSI 2026 Q1","e":"rsi","d":"2026-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Kyle Sauers","x":"The continued momentum we're seeing across player growth, marketing efficiency and profitability gives us confidence in our ability to deliver on our raised guidance and create long-term shareholder value.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/rush-street-rsi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"RSI 2026 Q3","e":"rsi","d":"2026-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Mike Hickey","x":"Just given the scenario of sort of slowing growth here, but the expectation for margin expansion, how are you thinking about, one, opportunities around maybe some cost-cutting initiatives?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/rush-street-interactive-rsi-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"RSI 2026 Q3","e":"rsi","d":"2026-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Kyle Sauers","x":"So I wouldn't anticipate any sort of cost-cutting initiative on our side.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/29/rush-street-interactive-rsi-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[61,1,7360,0,0,0,5860,1171],[64,1,8457,0,0,0,6953,1249],[65,1,8140,0,0,0,6515,1320],[67,1,8737,0,0,0,3053,5058]],"cinema":[[61,1,7360,0,0,0,5860,1171],[64,1,8457,0,0,0,6953,1249],[65,1,8140,0,0,0,6515,1320],[67,1,8737,0,0,0,3053,5058]],"imax":[[61,1,7360,0,0,0,5860,1171],[64,1,8457,0,0,0,6953,1249],[65,1,8140,0,0,0,6515,1320],[67,1,8737,0,0,0,3053,5058]],"streaming":[[61,1,7360,0,0,0,5860,1171],[64,1,8457,0,0,0,6953,1249],[65,1,8140,0,0,0,6515,1320],[67,1,8737,0,0,0,3053,5058]],"dtc":[[61,1,7360,0,0,0,5860,1171],[64,1,8457,0,0,0,6953,1249],[65,1,8140,0,0,0,6515,1320],[67,1,8737,0,0,0,3053,5058]],"ai_spend":[[61,1,7360,0,0,0,5860,1171],[64,1,8457,0,0,0,6953,1249],[65,1,8140,1,0,1,6515,1320],[67,1,8737,0,0,0,3053,5058]],"tariffs":[[61,1,7360,0,0,0,5860,1171],[64,1,8457,0,0,0,6953,1249],[65,1,8140,0,0,0,6515,1320],[67,1,8737,0,0,0,3053,5058]],"pricing_power":[[61,1,7360,2,2,0,5860,1171],[64,1,8457,1,1,0,6953,1249],[65,1,8140,0,0,0,6515,1320],[67,1,8737,0,0,0,3053,5058]],"cost_cuts":[[61,1,7360,0,0,0,5860,1171],[64,1,8457,0,0,0,6953,1249],[65,1,8140,0,0,0,6515,1320],[67,1,8737,2,0,2,3053,5058]],"guidance":[[61,1,7360,1,1,0,5860,1171],[64,1,8457,3,3,0,6953,1249],[65,1,8140,2,2,0,6515,1320],[67,1,8737,0,0,0,3053,5058]],"ai_disruption":[[61